{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "nav",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# Boss 选招｜流程子图\n14a E10/E11 已编码冻结，未构建/运行验收；图示为本批接口契约。\n[[GGYGO_流程_BossAI.canvas|返回主流程]] · [[GGYGO_结构_BossAI.canvas|结构图]] · [[BossAI/结构|完整契约]] · [[计划_BOSSAI|设计与验收]]",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 1940,
      "height": 175,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "tick",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "1. BT → ChooseBossAction::ExecuteTask。\nClearActionSelection + Blackboard::ClearValue 清旧请求。\n按 BossState::GetCurrentPhaseTag 从 Definition 取得 ActionSet。\nValidateConfiguration 失败 → 整集拒绝并诊断。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 351,
      "width": 410,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "candidates",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "2. 只保留合法可执行候选。\nBaseWeight=0 禁用；检查 Required/Blocked Tags、距离、角度、视线。\n复制原 SpecHandle 后调用 ASC::CanActivateAbilityByHandle。\n无候选 → Failed，不抽签。",
      "x": 480,
      "y": 351,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "random",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "3. Controller::SelectAction(Set, EligibleTags)。\n读取派生权重；全集合法且候选有正权重时 DrawActionWeight 一次抽签。\nRecordActionSelection 更新权重，StoreActionSelection 保存来源和原 Spec。\nBlackboard::SetValueAsName 写 Tag。",
      "x": 980,
      "y": 351,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 330,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "request",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "4. ActivateAbility::ExecuteTask 消费请求。\nConsumeActionSelection 检查 Set/Phase/ASC/Tag/Class/Spec/Avatar。\n成功或失败都清一次性记录/黑板。\n成功先订阅结束，再 TryActivateAbility(原 Handle)，不按 Class 重找 Spec。",
      "x": 1480,
      "y": 351,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 330,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "execute",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "5A. 成功：GA 驱动 Montage / Trace / GE；任务等能力结束。\n\nGA::ActivateAbility → Montage Task/Trace/GE；BTTask::HandleAbilityEnded 对同一 Handle 收尾并返回结果。",
      "x": 1480,
      "y": 824,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "fail",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "5B. 失败 → BT 返回 Failed。\n整集无效、无合法候选、来源/Spec 改变或 GAS 拒绝均不执行动作。\nCleanupBinding 清结束监听；重选/重置种子/附身变化/EndPlay 清短期请求。\nBaseWeight=0 不被恢复逻辑启用。",
      "x": 980,
      "y": 824,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 310,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "recover",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "3A. 合格候选惩罚全部耗尽。\nSelectAction 只恢复这些候选 BaseWeight，再继续本次抽签。\nRepeatPenalty=0 是软避重；唯一合法动作可再次选择。\n不恢复被目标/GAS 过滤的动作，不新增计时器。",
      "x": 480,
      "y": 824,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "3"
    }
  ],
  "edges": [
